Date: Tue, 14 Apr 2026 13:38:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 315/913] dts: stm32: include stm32mp25xc.dtsi in
 stm32mp25xf.dtsi

stm32mp25xf SoC support all the crypto peripheral defineded in
stm32mp25xc.dtsi
So include stm32mp25xc.dtsi in stm32mp25xf.dtsi
The only differences between the 2 SoC revisions are the OPP
frequencies. But they are managed dynamically by redeaing the SoC
revision in the OTP.

